# Artificial Evolution targets a spell too: Bot1 changes Bot2's Llanowar Elves spell, Elf to Goblin, in response. The
# effect goes on applying to the permanent the spell becomes (CR 400.7a): Llanowar Elves enters a Goblin Druid.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Artificial Evolution
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Artificial Evolution.Cast(Stack.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Elf)
Bot1.Modes(Goblin)

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Subtypes = Druid; Goblin
